    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Red Hat OpenShift support for OpenShift 4.7&nbsp;is now generally available. This release uses&nbsp;<a href=\"https://v1-20.docs.kubernetes.io/docs/setup/release/notes/\" title=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fv1-20.docs.kubernetes.io%2Fdocs%2Fsetup%2Frelease%2Fnotes%2F&amp;data=04%7C01%7Casabbour%40microsoft.com%7C77d89640d0f348b25a1308d925fb0a9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637582582437192706%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=uY2QOY6MrQ6n8OxZwm29z2cbu2DMPnnV7Q3s0RwzluQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kubernetes 1.20</a>&nbsp;with CRI-O runtime.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.openshift.com/container-platform/4.7/release_notes/ocp-4-7-release-notes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenShift 4.7</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about the <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/openshift/support-lifecycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Red Hat OpenShift release schedule</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Red Hat OpenShift support for OpenShift 4.7 is now generally available. This release uses Kubernetes 1.20 with CRI-O runtime.\n\nLearn more about OpenShift 4.7 .\n\nLearn more about the Azure Red Hat OpenShift release schedule ."
  },
